(c) any amo unt raised p

ursuant to any note purchase facility or the issue of bonds, notes, 
debentures, loan stock or any similar instrument;  
(d) the amount of any liability in respect of any lease or hire purchase contract which is 
deemed as a finance or capital leas e under the Indian Accounting Standards or such other 
accounting standards as may be prescribed;  
(e) receivables sold or discounted other than any receivables sold on non -recourse basis;  
(f) any amount raised under any other transaction, including any forw ard sale or purchase 
agreement, having the commercial effect of a borrowing;  

